    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Toremokinos ŋikabilae ŋulu alo Kuju Reoboam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Reoboam tolot Sekem, anerae acunakina Ŋisirael daadaŋ Sekem akituruwor iŋes erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat ŋakiro ŋun, (anerae ariŋa iŋes eyai Ijipit neni abu iŋes tosi aneni a erwosit Solomon), toboŋu alo Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiyarae ŋituŋa anyarare Yeroboam, torukut Yeroboam ka atukot a Ŋisirael daadaŋ, temasi neni a Reoboam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abu papa kon ikiinak isua egogos ŋolo apotyon, nai tokona kitowowok ŋiticisyo a papa kon ŋulu atyonok ka egogos keŋ ŋolo apotyon ŋolo abu iŋes ikiinak isua. Iŋes nai ikitiyanakinia isua iyoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok iŋes ikes tema: “Toloto a ne, kiriyata ŋirwa ŋiuni, ido nai toboŋut neni kaŋ.” Aŋun, apotu ŋituŋa toloto a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolot nai Reoboam aanyun ŋikasikou ŋulu sek etiyato neni a Solomon a papa keŋ apaki ŋina ayarya. Kiŋit ikes tema, “Anukiro ikilimokinete iyes ayoŋ ŋuna apedori ayoŋ aboŋokin ŋituŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokis ikes iŋes temasi, “Ani kicamit iyoŋ aruwor eketiyan a ŋituŋa a lu nakoloŋit na, kitoodiu atemar iinakina iyoŋ akitiya a ŋuna kec ka kirwor neni kec irimaana iboŋokini akiŋiset kec, ŋun nai ikitiyanakiniata ikes iyoŋ ŋikaru ka ŋikaru.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Reoboam tojamuwa ŋakiro ŋuna alimokinete ŋikasikou iŋes, tolot neni a ŋisorok a ŋulu arae ŋikesa keŋ a ŋulu etiyanakinete iŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiŋit Reoboam ikes tema, “Anukiro ikilimokinete iyes ayoŋ, ŋuna emaikina iwon oboŋokisi, ŋituŋa ŋulu akalimokis ayoŋ ebe, ‘Kitowowok egogos lo ŋolo abu papa kon ikiinak isua?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokis iŋes ŋikesa keŋ ŋul temasi, “Tolimok ŋituŋa ŋulu ebasi iyoŋ, ‘Abu papa kon ikiinak isua egogos ŋolo apotyon, nai emaikina iyoŋ kitowowok aneni kosi,’ tema iyoŋ ikes, ‘Nyepataka ŋiticisyo kaŋ a ŋolo cici, iloito ŋulu a papa kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu papa kaŋ ikiinak iyes egogos ŋolo apotyon, nai eturuwori ayoŋ egogos ŋol ŋolo apotyon nooi akilo neni sek. Abu papa kaŋ ikida iyes a ŋadase, nai akadai ayoŋ iyes a ibore a ŋini ikoni epipil akisorit a ekiitwan.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Yeroboam ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ toloto neni a Reoboam epete ŋirwa ŋiuni lopite ŋolo sek alimokinitor erwosit ikes ebe, “Toboŋutu neni kaŋ epete ŋirwa ŋiuni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok erwosit ŋituŋa ŋakiro eryenyaana, tojamuwa ŋakiro ŋuna alimokinete ŋikasikou iŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor iŋes lotuŋa iwuapit ŋuna alimokinete ŋisorok iŋes tema, “Abu papa kaŋ ikiinak iyes egogos ŋolo apotyon, nai eturuwori ayoŋ egogos ŋol ŋolo apotyon nooi akilo neni sek, abu papa kaŋ ikida iyes a ŋadase nai akadai ayoŋ iyes a ibore a ŋini ikoni epipil akisorit a ekiitwan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu erwosit toŋer ŋakiro a ŋituŋa, anerae arae neni ke Ekapolon abunitor akilocokinet ŋin, akisiyookin akirot ŋina aris Ekapolon kelimoki Yeroboam lokoku a Nebat aneni ka Aija a Esilonit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eyenunete Ŋisirael daadaŋ atemar aŋer erwosit akiirar ŋakiro kec, toboŋokis ikes erwosit temasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Apukan ŋina a ekiŋaren: Kipuka Yeroboam Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete Ŋisirael daadaŋ atemar aboŋu Yeroboam Isirael, kiyakiyasi ituŋanan anyaraun iŋes natukot a ŋituŋa ido kituruwosi iŋes erwosit ŋolo a Isirael a daadaŋ. Mam ituŋanan abu toriwo ke ekal a Daudi, mati ŋituŋa ke ekabila a Yuda make.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoluni Reoboam Yerusalem, tocunak ŋituŋa ŋulu ke ekabila a Yuda ka ŋulu ke ekabila a Benjamin, ŋituŋa ŋulu aseunitae ŋulu adolit ekimar kec ŋalipyo amiat ka ŋatomonikanikauni, ŋulu amaikina kitijioto Ŋisirael, ikotere inyakunete apukan a Isirael neni a Reoboam a lokoku a Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu akirot ka Akuj na bu neni a Semaia a ekile ŋolo amina Akuj ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tolimok Reoboam lokoku a Solomon erwosit ŋolo a Yuda ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu a ekal a Yuda ka Benjamin ta ŋituŋa ŋuluce daadaŋ ebe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Alimu Ekapolon ŋakiro nu: Nyitipeiyosi akitijiore ŋikaitotoi kus Ŋisirael. Apesi iyes daadaŋ lorerya kus, anerae ayoŋ alimu ŋakiro ŋun.’ ” Aŋun, apotu ŋituŋa kiirasi ŋakiro ke Ekapolon toboŋosi lorerya kec ikwapei alimokinia Ekapolon ikes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitiyau Yeroboam ŋitorubei a ŋitak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeroboam toduk etaun Sekem, nakwap a Epuraim ŋina a ŋikamukumukui, toruwor neni eboiyo iŋes nen, kedau akiduk nen, abu tolot toduk Penuel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totamak nai Yeroboam alotau tema, “Acepaki epedori apukan aboŋor neni a ŋituŋa a Daudi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "erae kerubakis ŋituŋa lu eayeneneete ŋamuronisya kec kai a Ekapolon Yerusalem, ido eriyete nabo ke ekapolon kec Reoboam erwosit ŋolo a Yudaya ka epedorete akiar ayoŋ, ido toboŋosi kipuka Reoboam erwosit ŋolo a Yudaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kedau erwosit akiŋitiŋit ŋituŋa ŋuna kitiya, abu totub akitiyaun ŋitak ŋiarei a egolid. Tolimok ŋituŋa tema, “Idaut iyes akitipeiyonor Yerusalem apaki ŋina aoyan. Ŋakujo kus ikes nu iyes Ŋisirael, ŋuna apotu ikiyaut iyes anakwap a ŋina a Ijipit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuak iŋes ŋakujo ŋun apei Besel ka ŋinace kiwuak Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋakiro ŋun toruwor asecit, anerae apotu ŋituŋa toloto akilip alokiŋaren akuj ŋina ayai Besel ka alokiŋaren ŋinace ŋina alwana ŋina ayai Dan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Yeroboam toduk ŋakais nakiboisyo ŋunamukur, ido toseununu ŋisacaradotin alokidiŋ ŋatekerin daadaŋ tari daŋ ŋina pa araakatar ikes ŋulu ka ateker a Lepi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totub Yeroboam atemar kitiyaeneneetei ŋasuban ŋuna ka akwap keŋ ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋikan elap ŋolo a ŋikanikauni, lopite ŋolo etiyata ŋulu a Yudaya. Ya Yeroboam ŋamuronisya Namuroet ŋina ayai Besel, inak ŋamuronisya ŋun neni a ŋitak a ŋulu abu iŋes kitiyau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋikan, elap ŋolo abu Yeroboam bon toseu, abu iŋes ya ŋamuronisya Namuroet ŋina aris iŋes kedukoki Besel. Aŋun, abu iŋes. togeu ŋasuban ŋun aŋuna a Ŋisirael, ido abu tolot Namuroet akicuny ekinyate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
